          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Residential Plots</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Strategically located residential land parcels with clear legal titles, ideal for building custom dream homes or long-term wealth appreciation.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center text-xs font-semibold text-gold-400">
          <span>Explore Plots</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"></i>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 2: Commercial Properties -->
      <a href="<%= properties_path(property_type: 'Commercial') %>" class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-obsidian-900 p-6 hover:border-gold-500/50 transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between block">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gold-500/10 border border-gold-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-gold-400 text-xl mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-building-user"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Commercial Real Estate</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            High-traffic retail spaces, corporate office hubs, and commercial complexes engineered for maximum business growth and rental yield.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center text-xs font-semibold text-gold-400">
          <span>Explore Commercial</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"></i>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 3: Investment Opportunities -->
      <a href="<%= properties_path(section: 'latest_projects') %>" class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-obsidian-900 p-6 hover:border-gold-500/50 transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between block">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gold-500/10 border border-gold-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-gold-400 text-xl mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Investment Advisory</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Data-backed investment advisory targeting high capital appreciation, pre-launch developments, and strong return-on-investment projects.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center text-xs font-semibold text-gold-400">
          <span>Explore Investments</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"></i>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 4: Dream Homes -->
      <a href="<%= properties_path(property_type: 'Residential') %>" class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-obsidian-900 p-6 hover:border-gold-500/50 transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between block">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gold-500/10 border border-gold-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-gold-400 text-xl mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-house-chimney-window"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Dream Homes</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Handpicked luxury apartments, villas, and family residences crafted for comfort, safety, and timeless architectural beauty.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center text-xs font-semibold text-gold-400">
          <span>Find Your Home</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"></i>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Core Pillars & Vision Section -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-r from-obsidian-900 via-obsidian-950 to-obsidian-900 p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="text-gold-500 font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs uppercase block mb-3">Our Core Philosophy</span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white font-bold leading-tight mb-6">Built on Integrity, Driven by Excellence</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-500/20 border border-gold-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-gold-400 shrink-0 mt-1">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-shield text-xs"></i>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Uncompromising Honesty & Transparency</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-400 mt-1">We believe trust is earned through full disclosure, genuine advice, and crystal-clear transaction terms without hidden caveats.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-500/20 border border-gold-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-gold-400 shrink-0 mt-1">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-users text-xs"></i>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Client-Centric Commitment</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-400 mt-1">Every buyer, seller, or investor receives bespoke attention, ensuring complete satisfaction and long-term partnership.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gold-500/20 border border-gold-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-gold-400 shrink-0 mt-1">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-globe text-xs"></i>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Pan-India & Global Expansion</h4>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-400 mt-1">Starting with strong roots in prime Indian real estate hubs, our goal is to scale Dua Real Estate into a globally recognized signature brand.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Vision Graphic Card -->
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gold-500/20 shadow-2xl relative z-10 space-y-6">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-400">Our Tagline Promise</span>
              <i class="fa-solid fa-certificate text-gold-400"></i>
            </div>
            
            <blockquote class="font-serif text-2xl text-white italic leading-snug">
              "Building Trust, Creating Value."
            </blockquote>
            
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
              This motto defines our everyday mission. For us, success is measured not just in square feet sold, but in the trust earned and value created for every single customer.
            </p>

            <div class="pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between">
              <div>
                <span class="block text-[10px] text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Brand Founder</span>
                <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Arun Kumar</span>
              </div>
              <a href="<%= contact_path %>" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-600 text-obsidian-950 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-all">Get in Touch</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 w-full h-full rounded-2xl border border-gold-500/10 bg-gold-500/5 -z-10"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Client Words of Trust / Testimonials -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <span class="text-gold-500 font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs uppercase block mb-2">Testimonials</span>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white font-bold">What Our Clients Say</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-3 text-sm">Real stories from buyers and investors who trusted Dua Real Estate for their journey.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-obsidian-900 p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex text-gold-400 text-xs gap-1">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-300 italic leading-relaxed">
            "Arun Kumar provided exceptional guidance when we bought our plot. Clear documentation, no hidden surprises, and absolute transparency throughout."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
          <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Rajesh Sharma</h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-400">Residential Plot Buyer</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-obsidian-900 p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex text-gold-400 text-xs gap-1">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-300 italic leading-relaxed">
            "Dua Real Estate helped us secure a high-yield commercial space for our business. Honest advice and incredible market insight!"
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
          <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Vikram Malhotra</h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-400">Commercial Investor</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-obsidian-900 p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex text-gold-400 text-xs gap-1">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-300 italic leading-relaxed">
            "Finding our dream family home felt seamless with Dua Real Estate. Arun personally ensured complete satisfaction from start to finish."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
          <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Pooja & Anish Mehta</h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-400">Homeowners</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
